WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.180
I'm home.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:08.980
Welcome home.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.860
We're having hamburg steaks tonight.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.500
Good job, Mom.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.970
A spirit.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.710
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.010
Nothing.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.900
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.170
<i>I wonder why.</i>

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:12.750
What's wrong, Sakura?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.420
Hurry up and eat.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.970
Yeah.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.910
Is it good?

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.220
It's great.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.310
That's good.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:28.500
<i>I really wonder why...</i>

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.030
A Home Without Spirits

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.970
What? You're bothered by all 
the spirits you're seeing?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:08.160
Yeah.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.840
Why now?

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.830
You've gotten used to seeing spirits 
ever since you were little, right?

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:13.950
Yeah.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:18.710
But they never came into my house before.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:22.470
And suddenly, ever since yesterday...

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:23.790
Suddenly?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:28.970
They're not causing any actual 
trouble, but they're distracting.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:33.490
Rokudou-kun, could you figure out why for me?

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:34.510
All right.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.190
I'll do it.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:39.360
Then can you come to my 
place after school today?

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:40.390
Yeah.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.060
See you after school.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.180
<i>Mamiya Sakura's home, huh?</i>

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.620
<i>I've taken her to her window one time,</i>

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.160
<i>but this is the first time 
I've been invited over.</i>

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.730
What's wrong with him?

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:56.130
Weirdo.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.600
<i>Rokudou's skipping in joy.</i>

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.010
<i>What happened?</i>

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.850
Hey, let's go to karaoke after school.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.000
Sorry, I have to go home early today.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.610
What for? Studying?

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.100
Let's study together, then.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.980
No, I just have things to do.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.510
Okay.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.540
See you tomorrow.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:21.440
See you.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.750
Didn't she seem giddy?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.200
Yeah, she's definitely not not giddy.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.880
Rinne-sama.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.540
Rinne-sama.

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:40.230
Rinne-sama!

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:42.180
What, Rokumon?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.220
What do you mean, "what"?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.900
You need to get ready.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.930
We have a spirit meeting today.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:48.970
Meeting?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.080
Did you forget?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.600
It's a Shinigami Tool workshop.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.950
Oh, was it?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:05:00.120
I wonder what kind of tools 
they'll be revealing today.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.690
I hope there's something useful.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.310
Rokumon, go in my place for today.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:13.500
Staaaaaaaaaaare.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:18.380
Mixed Fruits

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:18.380
Tangerine

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:18.380
Why have you been staring 
at these cans and sighing?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.130
Are they gifts?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:24.030
Are you blowing off the 
workshop to go somewhere?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.880
Bingo

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.880
<i>He nailed it.</i>

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.140
Rinne, let's go.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.920
Ageha.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.310
Let's go to the workshop together.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:38.650
There.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.570
What was that for?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.010
A smoke bomb.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.230
Rinne's gone!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:53.200
And he took the slightly more 
expensive mixed fruits can!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.760
What's going on?

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:56.130
This is suspicious.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.460
Jumonji.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:02.040
What is Rokudou scheming?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.680
Let's find out, then.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.600
What's that?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.470
A tracking reel.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.130
I tied the end of it to Rinne-sama.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.970
We can follow him that way.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.170
Brilliant!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.170
After him!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.850
There, that about does it.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.410
That's pretty good.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:39.580
I know he's just coming to do an exorcism, 
but it's going to be his first time here.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:44.260
<i>Actually, it's the first time 
I'm having a boy in my room.</i>

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.090
Sakura, your friends are here.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.810
Okay.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.200
Hey, Mamiya-san.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.830
Sakura-sama.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.480
Oh, this is your place?

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:04.360
Mamiya-san.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.630
This isn't much, but...

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:08.490
Just when did you get changed?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.360
H-Here.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.750
It's not exactly not much, but...

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.490
It's okay, you didn't have to bother.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:23.320
You're taking it home?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.070
Come in, everyone.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.210
Make yourselves at home.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.460
Thanks for having us!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.750
You're an adorable girl.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.430
Are you in Sakura's class?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.120
Mom, you can see her?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.680
Yes, why?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:42.550
Normal people can't see Ageha the Shinigami,

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:46.570
but by switching her ribbon, 
she can reveal herself.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.240
I'm here to hang out against 
you, fair and square!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.660
I'm not really here to hang out.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.870
Well, come to my room, then.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.360
<i>Mamiya-san's room!</i>

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.830
This is my first time being 
in Mamiya-san's room.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.150
I've been there before.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:06.160
What?!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.090
He comes over sometimes.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.050
What?!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.730
Rokumon!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.090
I never heard about this!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.000
I know. I never told you.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.830
Why you little...

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.510
You're nothing but a cat!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.530
No, is it <i>because</i> you're a cat?

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:22.850
I'm not jealous!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.810
I'm not sad or anything!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.400
You damn cat!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.010
You are.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:36.110
One, two, one, two...

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.740
He wasn't here earlier.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.950
Bastard!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.780
Practicing the bridge in front of 
Mamiya-san's room, of all places!

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:46.750
One, two, one, two...

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:44.660
Scram!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.000
Holy Ash!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.500
Oh, my God!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:50.970
Defeated.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:53.240
Ow.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.180
It's dusty!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.130
It's an exorcism. What can I do?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:09:00.600
Mamiya-san, you could have talked 
to me about this kind of stuff.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.680
This is exactly why she couldn't talk to you.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.170
Rokudou.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:08.600
<i>You</i> tried to steal the show under 
the pretext of an exorcism.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.570
I got called for a job.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.570
Oh, my. Don't fight.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.870
Of course, Mother.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.320
You don't have the right 
to call her "mom."

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.330
There you are.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.950
Make yourselves at home.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.850
Look at all these other people 
making themselves at home, too.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:34.660
But Rinne, but they all seem like 
harmless spirits just passing by.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.960
Jumonji might have been 
good enough for the job.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.290
Yeah, exactly.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.100
Huh?

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:42.570
There's no reason for Rinne to do it.

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.230
Just leave the rest to him.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.060
Let's go to the workshop together.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.660
Wait, Ageha.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.810
Just exorcising them 
doesn't solve the problem.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.440
Why not?

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.820
You see, Mamiya Sakura's home, 
at first glance, is a normal home.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:57.980
Yeah.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:01.330
Mom's a stay-at-home mom, and Dad's a banker.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:06.860
So this current state, with occasional 
ghosts passing through, is what's normal.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:08.250
This is?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:13.800
What's weird is that no spirits 
passed through until yesterday.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:18.430
In other words, there was something 
deterring spirits until now...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.680
...and that something is gone now?

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.040
Yeah.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.340
So if we can find out what that something is,

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:27.060
we can make the spirits stop 
coming to this house again.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.990
Oh, that's easy.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.260
We just have to stop spirits 
from coming here, right?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:37.110
Shinigami Tool, Guard Dog's Collar!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:39.730
Come forth!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.080
The spirits are running off!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.360
See?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.380
With this guard dog here, we don't 
need to worry about spirits.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.460
He's not even trained properly!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.180
I can't keep him.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:03.930
House!

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.310
I was so scared, Rinne!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:13.310
You two sure are close.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:14.810
Boo hoo.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.570
I only wanted to help.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.250
Sorry.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.830
It's okay if you can't do anything.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.280
So far there haven't been any actual 
problems with the spirits passing by.

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.610
That's not good enough.

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:29.290
I'm going to finish my job.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:34.450
<i>But first I need to get 
rid of Jumonji and Ageha.</i>

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:37.880
Good boy.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.380
Where'd you come from?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:51.020
Shinigami Tool Workshop

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:51.020
<i>Shinigami Tool Workshop:</i>

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:57.220
<i>a Shinigami Tool study group 
aimed at young Shinigamis.</i>

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:01.310
<i>The instructors are veteran 
Shinigamis teaching on rotation.</i>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:05.910
The next tool is a state-of-the-art 
evil spirit trap.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:11.910
As you know, it's a classic item for 
catching evil spirits in their paths.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:20.360
The scent packs have been improved 
to better attract evil spirits.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:27.000
Just for you, you can buy 
one and get one free!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.950
If you don't notice any results,

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:35.910
we'll take them back no questions 
asked for the first thirty days.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:40.600
Buy within the next thirty 
minutes and shipping is on us.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.580
Call this number now.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:53.580
Those are all the new Shinigami Tools.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.230
We have samples at the entrance hall.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.630
Be sure to try them out.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.850
Okay.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:03.750
<i>So is Rinne absent today?</i>

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.300
<i>He's never missed a class.</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.680
<i>I'm surprised he wouldn't come 
when he can get free samples.</i>

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:14.450
<i>I was hoping to buy him anmitsu later.</i>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.060
Sakura.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.560
Yes?

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.300
What, Mom?

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.070
Your friends are staying 
over for dinner, right?

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.530
Yeah, probably.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.490
<i>It looks like it's still 
going to take a while.</i>

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:38.120
Aren't these free samples from 
the Shinigami Tool Workshop?

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.290
Yeah.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.820
I've stocked them up.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.630
Oh?

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:44.630
You can get rid of the 
spirits here with that junk?

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:45.970
Yeah.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.260
<i>But the first ones I'm going to get rid of...</i>

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.560
Look, an evil spirit.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.440
No, you just pulled that out yourself.

00:13:57.440 --> 00:14:05.190
Evil Spirit Balloons

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:00.030
<i>These Evil Spirit Balloons</i>

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:05.200
<i>are fake evil spirits designed to 
fight against real evil spirits.</i>

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.730
What was that for, you stupid balloon?!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:21.210
Jeez, I told you to stop 
throwing Holy Ash everywhere.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:30.850
That thing was discontinued after 
they distributed samples, wasn't it?

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:35.100
It can't tell apart evil spirits and humans.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.940
<i>I've managed to get rid of Jumonji.</i>

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.230
<i>Next...</i>

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.460
Boop.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.860
It's just us now, Rinne.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.910
What are you doing?

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.370
You're back already?

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.570
Mamiya Sakura.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.740
No, this isn't...

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:58.610
You got caught being bad in Sakura-sama's 
room of all places, Rinne-sama.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.620
I wish you'd do it somewhere else.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:01.880
Did you hear that?

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.200
Let's go, Rinne.

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.750
Hang on.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:20.770
Easy-to-use Reidou Spawner Pencil

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.770
<i>Easy-to-use Reidou Spawner Pencil.</i>

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:20.770
<i>Just draw a circle and you 
have a hole to the Reidou.</i>

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.560
That's that pencil that got 
discontinued after kid Shinigamis

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.780
opened Reidous everywhere.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.240
<i>Finally, all the pests are gone.</i>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.430
Rokudou!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.570
You...

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.450
Oh, Tsubasa-kun.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:36.940
What's that for?

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.080
Come forth!

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.360
Rinne! What was that for?!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:46.840
<i>Ding!</i>

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.100
What?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:03.350
Shikigami RC

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:59.080
<i>Shikigami RC.</i>

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:03.350
<i>Lets you control anyone you put 
the antenna on like a Shikigami.</i>

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.240
That's that product that caused 
problems because people

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.630
couldn't see where they were going.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.990
What do you think you're doing, Rokudou?!

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.120
Pop.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.870
Wings to the Afterlife

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.870
<i>And these are the Wings to the Afterlife.</i>

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.410
That's the product that got discontinued 
because of range anxiety.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.340
You're not going to stop me so easily.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.340
Huh, he's back.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.340
<i>It's defective.</i>

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.940
Rokudou, you bastard!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.710
What did I ever do to you?

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:38.980
Dinner time, guys.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.520
Don't be shy.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:45.900
You can ask for more.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:48.650
More!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.010
Okay.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:51.740
Rokudou!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.280
What did I ever do to you?

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.540
Look!

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:55.360
What?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.560
Bop!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.910
I'm not falling for the same trick!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.010
Heave!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:27.980
Barrier Duct Tape

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.230
<i>Barrier Duct Tape.</i>

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.120
<i>This isn't a sample; it's on the market.</i>

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.300
<i>600 yen a roll.</i>

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.870
You set up a barrier from 
inside, didn't you?!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:38.050
That'll keep Ageha and Jumonji out.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.200
Now we can finally talk together in peace.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.290
This isn't peaceful.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.000
What?

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:50.210
They got trapped inside by the barriers.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.270
Anyway, try to remember carefully.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:56.870
The spirits never came through this house.

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:59.090
Now, all of a sudden, they do.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:01.240
Did you throw something out?

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.260
Did you move something?

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.220
Do you remember?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.390
Let me think.

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.770
I don't think so.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.660
What's this, Rokudou-kun?

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:15.150
Those are Shinigami Tool samples.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.730
<i>Samples?</i>

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.030
That reminds me...

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:26.410
When I wandered into the Kyoukai as 
a kid, your grandma helped me out.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.760
Right after she erased my memory,

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:33.290
as I was walking down the road 
back to the living world...

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.120
Miss.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.560
Free samples!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:40.550
There.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.350
Pretty.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:51.740
It was really pretty, so I never threw 
it out, but I packed it up at some point.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:52.730
Found it.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:56.360
Here.

00:18:58.390 --> 00:18:59.820
An hourglass.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.300
Huh?

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:05.990
The sand was rainbow-colored 
and shiny when I got it.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.540
It's all black now.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:08.910
<i>Ding!</i>

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:11.030
Mamiya Sakura.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:11.920
That solves it.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.920
Really, Rokudou-kun?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:17.500
That's a Shinigami Tool: 
an Exorcism Hourglass.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.480
An Exorcism Hourglass?

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:22.680
I've seen the samples 
being handed out before.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:27.430
Then is this why I never had 
spirits come near my house?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:28.740
Yeah.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:30.960
That hourglass has an exorcism effect.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:37.190
And the reason they started coming all 
of a sudden is because it's expired.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.450
Found.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.360
Replaceable sand samples.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.360
Replaceable?

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:45.330
It's no good, there's 
barriers on all the doors.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.100
Dammit, Rokudou.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.830
I'm just going to blow it up and charge in!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.760
Wait, I have a great idea.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.840
Coming.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.140
My, what are these stickers?

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.540
Oh, my.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:04.710
Coming through.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.350
I never thought of that.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.350
Pretty.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:16.480
Set the new sand in the hourglass, 
and it'll start exorcising again.

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:23.080
That'll last ten years.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.580
The spirits are gone.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.990
Problem solved.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.180
Thanks, Rokudou-kun.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.450
I knew I could count on you.

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:35.000
<i>Are you happy, Mamiya Sakura?</i>

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.840
How could you kick us out?!

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:41.840
Rokudou, what were you doing 
alone with Mamiya-san?!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.090
I told you, an exorcism.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.290
An exorcism?

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.710
What are you dreaming about?

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.050
You haven't done it.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.090
What?

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:53.570
Ow!

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:54.350
Ow!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.610
You suck, Rinne!

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.870
What did we do?

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.920
I'll go pick up another 
sample from the afterlife.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.610
Sure.

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:09.120
Exorcism Hourglass?

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.100
Oh, that.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:20.340
Shop

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:13.360
We don't have any more samples, sadly.

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.760
Don't tell me they got discontinued.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:18.350
No, it was really popular for once,

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:20.340
so it's being released officially 
starting this month.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.510
It's a product now?

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:25.570
It was just shown at the workshop.

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.680
Here you go, 20,000 yen.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:29.960
20,000 yen?!

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.920
Taxes not included.

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.480
Before taxes, even.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:41.570
You really found one, huh?

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.500
Yeah, Mamiya Sakura, this is...

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.280
Thanks, Rokudou-kun.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.700
I really can count on you.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.030
No, uh, that's...

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:54.690
I can't believe you can get 
samples for something like this.

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:56.290
Good job, Rokudou-kun.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.900
I'm glad you're happy, Mamiya Sakura.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:02.340
I'll take good care of it.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:10.930
<i>You can't tell her you paid for it, huh?</i>

00:22:16.490 --> 00:22:17.730
They're gone.

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:21.780
That's so much better.

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:27.700
I did good, right?

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:30.420
Is that a reward for yourself?

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
M's Tragedy

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:05.790
One of our tasks at the Mortal Census 
Bureau, aside from managing lifespans,

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.710
is to crack down on those who 
manipulate lifespans illegally.

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:09.670
What a waste of time.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.020
Who cares if it's a couple years off?

00:24:12.020 --> 00:24:13.550
You could say that.

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:15.160
What do you want?!

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:16.760
My name is Masato.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.710
Please, don't mind me.

00:24:18.710 --> 00:24:19.810
We do mind you!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:21.110
Good grief.

00:24:21.110 --> 00:24:24.740
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>:
"M's Tragedy."

00:24:24.740 --> 00:24:25.980
Enjoy.
